<SceneText>
  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43184,43424,43528,43724,44088,44436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Suzu&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43280,43796,43912,44020,44200,44268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43616,44372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43188</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>改めてお詫びします。
申し訳ありませんでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I would like to apologize again, properly.
There is no excuse for our actions.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もういいって。
大変だったのはわかるからさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, it's fine. We know this
is a tough time for you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いえ……私たちは、一族の者がダオスに洗脳された
汚名をそそぎ、名誉回復のため精進してきました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, no... Since Dhaos's brainwashing of our clan
members, we've been working to clear our name.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……私は、その功を
少し焦りすぎたのかもしれません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And perhaps I've been too
aggressive in my pursuit of merit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだったんだ。ダオス戦役の時の……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I see. So, because of what
happened during Dhaos's War...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いけませんね……世界がこんな時に、
一族のためなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, to think only of my clan, while
the world is in peril... It's unacceptable.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43800</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……そんなことないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Hey, it's
not that bad.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>世界を守りたいっても、それって
自分の周りが大事だからなんだよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You want to protect the world *because* the
people around you are important to you, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だからさ、&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんの一族のためっての
わかるぜ、オレ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, y'know, if you do all this for the
sake of your clan, &lt;Suzu&gt;, I get that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44092</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;さん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44204</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレだって、オレの住むとこなくなんの
ヤだから戦うんだもんな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, I'm fighting myself 'cause I
don't want to lose where I live.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44272</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほら、行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44376</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……そっか、&lt;Dio&gt;……
バジルさんのことをまだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Oh... You're still thinking
of Basil, aren't you, &lt;Dio&gt;...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_065_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
